  "postText": "<p><HTML><HEAD><meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\"></HEAD><body></p>\n<div align=\"center\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/208/97480355f16709570e0483a6646d89da..jpg\"></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">今日でツギハギスタッカートが</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">9周年らしい！！！！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">すごい！！！！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">昔から聞いてた曲だから時の流れに驚きです</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">、、、</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">とあさんはボカロPで1番好きです</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">ほんとに</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">きいてね</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">今日は2時間睡眠で</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">一限に行き、</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">睡眠睡眠睡眠の日々</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">私ぼっちでさ</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">陽キャたちに空いてる椅子何個か持ってかれて</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">ちょっと悲しかった°˖✧◝(⁰▿⁰)◜✧˖°</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">でも私はめげないっ！！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">なぜなら無敵だから、、♪</div>\n<p></body></HTML></p>\n",
